  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, once per week the guide can use <em>wish</em> as a spell-like ability. However, the guide may not request the wish and the ability will fail if the guide seeks to influence the request (at the GM’s discretion. A guide cannot ask someone else to wish for something for them for example). The wish must benefit the creature wishing and must be approved by the guide (she has a choice if she wishes to grant the wish or not). A guide need not have the material component for the wish spell and may cast it as a swift action.</p>\n<p>This replaces the limited wishes class feature of the guide.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/guide#toc51\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
